Package: stochvolTMB
Type: Package
Title: Likelihood Estimation of Stochastic Volatility Models
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-11-06
Authors@R: person("Jens", "Wahl", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jens.c.wahl@gmail.com")
Description: Parameter estimation for stochastic volatility models using maximum likelihood. The latent log-volatility is 
    integrated out of the likelihood using the Laplace approximation. The models are fitted via 'TMB' (Template Model
    Builder) (Kristensen, Nielsen, Berg, Skaug, and Bell (2016) <doi:10.18637/jss.v070.i05>). The observation error can
    be Gaussian, t, skew-Gaussian or skew t (Jones and Faddy (2003) <doi:10.1111/1467-9868.00378>), with or without
    leverage. Exact one-step-ahead residuals, Value at Risk and Expected Shortfall are calculated with a filter on a
    grid for the log-volatility, and the Value at Risk can be backtested with the tests of Kupiec (1995)
    <doi:10.3905/jod.1995.407942> and Christoffersen (1998) <doi:10.2307/2527341>.
License: GPL-3
